WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.624 --> 00:00:17.768
The Metro City Art Gallery was very crowded.

2
00:00:19.169 --> 00:00:21.049
People were excited to see the new paintings.

3
00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:25.091
"These paintings are beautiful," said a woman.

4
00:00:26.211 --> 00:00:27.051
Her husband nodded.

5
00:00:27.071 --> 00:00:32.180
"Yes, they are very— Hey!

6
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.781
What's going on here?"

7
00:00:34.741 --> 00:00:36.622
A thick fog slowly filled the room.

8
00:00:36.642 --> 00:00:39.122
"I can't see anything!"

9
00:00:39.442 --> 00:00:40.142
shouted a voice.

10
00:00:42.963 --> 00:00:44.744
When the fog cleared, a woman gasped.

11
00:00:44.764 --> 00:00:46.544
"Oh no!

12
00:00:46.804 --> 00:00:48.025
The paintings are gone!"

13
00:00:48.045 --> 00:00:51.746
"Watch this!"

14
00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:52.866
shouted Jack.

15
00:00:53.866 --> 00:00:56.587
He ran across Terrell's backyard as fast as he could.

16
00:00:57.367 --> 00:01:02.257
He jumped—ka-boosh!—and landed in the big pile of leaves.

17
00:01:03.118 --> 00:01:04.098
They flew everywhere.

18
00:01:04.118 --> 00:01:06.380
"Ha-ha!" Roxy laughed.

19
00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:08.401
"It's my turn!"

20
00:01:08.821 --> 00:01:09.382
said Mara.

21
00:01:12.343 --> 00:01:13.424
Everyone grabbed a rake.

22
00:01:17.547 --> 00:01:20.028
They all started raking leaves back into a huge pile.

23
00:01:21.389 --> 00:01:23.170
Soon it was ready for Mara to jump in.

24
00:01:24.151 --> 00:01:25.812
She walked to the other end of the backyard.

25
00:01:29.576 --> 00:01:31.797
Then she ran toward the leaves and jumped!

26
00:01:33.358 --> 00:01:35.278
"Woo-hoo!" yelled Mara.

27
00:01:35.298 --> 00:01:40.661
"This is so much fun," said Terrell as he picked up his rake.

28
00:01:40.681 --> 00:01:43.102
"Yeah," said Roxy.

29
00:01:43.122 --> 00:01:45.743
"Fall is my favorite season.

30
00:01:46.603 --> 00:01:47.824
I love the cool air.

31
00:01:48.184 --> 00:01:49.644
And I love playing in the leaves."

32
00:01:52.446 --> 00:01:55.247
"My favorite season is winter," said Terrell.

33
00:01:55.267 --> 00:01:57.768
"I love playing in the snow."

34
00:01:58.908 --> 00:02:01.690
"I can't wait for it to start snowing," said Jack.

35
00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.791
"I wish it would snow now!"

36
00:02:03.811 --> 00:02:07.853
"It's still too warm for snow," said Roxy.

37
00:02:07.873 --> 00:02:12.315
"I don't think it will snow for a few more months."

38
00:02:12.335 --> 00:02:15.237
"You're probably right," said Jack with a sigh.

39
00:02:16.897 --> 00:02:19.319
The friends finished raking the leaves back into a pile.

40
00:02:20.399 --> 00:02:21.580
Then it was Roxy's turn.

41
00:02:27.212 --> 00:02:29.254
"Whee!" Roxy shouted as she jumped into the pile.

42
00:02:30.495 --> 00:02:33.277
As the friends raked the leaves again, Terrell had an idea.

43
00:02:33.297 --> 00:02:37.100
"We should ask Rocket Girl to make it snow!"

44
00:02:37.381 --> 00:02:37.821
he said.

45
00:02:37.841 --> 00:02:41.264
"That's a ridiculous idea," said Roxy.

46
00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:44.627
"Rocket Girl has no control over the weather."

47
00:02:44.647 --> 00:02:47.849
"But she has super powers!"

48
00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:49.251
said Terrell.

49
00:02:50.972 --> 00:02:53.214
Before Roxy could respond, her watch beeped.

50
00:02:54.415 --> 00:02:55.496
"Uh-oh," she thought.

51
00:02:56.392 --> 00:02:57.412
She looked at her friends.

52
00:02:57.432 --> 00:03:00.013
"Sorry, guys," she said.

53
00:03:00.033 --> 00:03:03.754
"But I just remembered I told my mom I'd be home for lunch.

54
00:03:04.634 --> 00:03:05.515
I'll be back later."

55
00:03:08.815 --> 00:03:11.956
As soon as Roxy was in front of Terrell's house, she answered the call.

56
00:03:16.498 --> 00:03:17.618
Bloom," she said.

57
00:03:17.638 --> 00:03:19.198
"What's going on?"

58
00:03:19.218 --> 00:03:22.919
"We have a problem, Rocket Girl," said Mayor Bloom.

59
00:03:22.939 --> 00:03:24.960
"There's been a robbery.

60
00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:29.872
All the new paintings at the Metro City Art Gallery have been stolen!"

61
00:03:29.892 --> 00:03:32.677
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

62
00:03:32.697 --> 00:03:35.323
"Rocket Girl is on her way!"
